      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Standing practice on EVERY batch;\nagent-driven, interactive only when no\nbrowser is reachable.\n\nqueue/salesnav-pending.md backlog first,\nthen this run's survivors, ≤\nlimits.salesnav_lookups_per_run with\nhuman-like pacing. Overflow stays queued\nfor the next run.\n\nIt keeps catching disqualifiers the APIs\nmissed — this is why headless routing is\nprovisional.",
      "originalText": "Standing practice on EVERY batch; agent-driven, interactive only when no browser is reachable.\n\nqueue/salesnav-pending.md backlog first, then this run's survivors, ≤ limits.salesnav_lookups_per_run with human-like pacing. Overflow stays queued for the next run.\n\nIt keeps catching disqualifiers the APIs missed — this is why headless routing is provisional.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
