      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "browser/extension unreachable or an auth\nwall = connector flake: one ~60s retry,\nthen degrade to the browserless profile —\nsurvivors queued, no enrollment, run\nreports DEGRADED. Never a failed batch,\nnever a looser verification source.",
      "originalText": "browser/extension unreachable or an auth wall = connector flake: one ~60s retry, then degrade to the browserless profile — survivors queued, no enrollment, run reports DEGRADED. Never a failed batch, never a looser verification source.",
