      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "node lib/sequence-resolver.ts <domain> →\nENROLL <id> (+ required merge fields) or\nHOLD. A match on a non-active sequence\nHOLDs — never a fallback to some other\nsequence — and becomes enrollable the\nmoment a successor flips to active.\n\nHARD GATE before ANY enrollment: Apollo DNC\nlist + Twenty outreachStatus/sequenceStatus\nOPTED_OUT + store\nopted-out/skipped/never_enroll.\n\nMulti-thread (operator + tech owner); 2nd\nsame-company contact needs\nsequence_same_company_in_same_campaign.\nNever fabricate an address — HOLD instead.\nCaps: config/sequences.yaml caps:, read at\nrun time.",
      "originalText": "node lib/sequence-resolver.ts <domain> → ENROLL <id> (+ required merge fields) or HOLD. A match on a non-active sequence HOLDs — never a fallback to some other sequence — and becomes enrollable the moment a successor flips to active.\n\nHARD GATE before ANY enrollment: Apollo DNC list + Twenty outreachStatus/sequenceStatus OPTED_OUT + store opted-out/skipped/never_enroll.\n\nMulti-thread (operator + tech owner); 2nd same-company contact needs sequence_same_company_in_same_campaign. Never fabricate an address — HOLD instead. Caps: config/sequences.yaml caps:, read at run time.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
