      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "MIRRORING — reads accounts/, writes Twenty,\nfetches nothing, interprets nothing.\n\nUpsert company by domainName.primaryLinkUrl\n+ people by apolloContactId (fallback\nemail). Owned-field set per\nlib/status-map.ts. ONE note per account per\nbatch; notes/tasks/opportunities dedupe on\ntitle+companyId so a re-run never\nduplicates.\n\nDropped accounts are excluded\nunconditionally, even with a stale crm\npointer.",
      "originalText": "MIRRORING — reads accounts/, writes Twenty, fetches nothing, interprets nothing.\n\nUpsert company by domainName.primaryLinkUrl + people by apolloContactId (fallback email). Owned-field set per lib/status-map.ts. ONE note per account per batch; notes/tasks/opportunities dedupe on title+companyId so a re-run never duplicates.\n\nDropped accounts are excluded unconditionally, even with a stale crm pointer.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
