      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Records for HUMANS; M8 mirrors machine\nstate to the CRM. Both read the same\naccount.yaml diffs; neither writes the\nother's targets.\n\nregistry entry · batch digest (funnel,\ncredit spend, “reply go” line) ·\nprogress.md · structured run record\ncarrying the FLIP RATE (headless route vs.\npost-Sales-Nav final) — the production\nerror rate the eval suite predicts.",
      "originalText": "Records for HUMANS; M8 mirrors machine state to the CRM. Both read the same account.yaml diffs; neither writes the other's targets.\n\nregistry entry · batch digest (funnel, credit spend, “reply go” line) · progress.md · structured run record carrying the FLIP RATE (headless route vs. post-Sales-Nav final) — the production error rate the eval suite predicts.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
