      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "HUMAN ONLY. Never headless, never inferred\nfrom context, never “implied” by a passing\nbatch. A human names the batch; M4 unpauses\nprecisely that batch and confirms counts\nback.\n\nEverything upstream of here is autonomous —\nwhich is exactly why this stays a hand on\nthe switch.",
      "originalText": "HUMAN ONLY. Never headless, never inferred from context, never “implied” by a passing batch. A human names the batch; M4 unpauses precisely that batch and confirms counts back.\n\nEverything upstream of here is autonomous — which is exactly why this stays a hand on the switch.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
