      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "The gatherer half: capture → diff\ncontact_campaign_statuses against\naccount.yaml → update the store → push to\nTwenty with a note per change.\n\nInterest reply → company REPLIED +\nOpportunity (NEW → SCREENING → MEETING →\nPROPOSAL → CUSTOMER) + respond-task + the\nreply pasted into a note.\n\nUnsubscribe/negative reply → the\npre-authorized opt-out procedure, executed\ninstantly across all three systems.",
      "originalText": "The gatherer half: capture → diff contact_campaign_statuses against account.yaml → update the store → push to Twenty with a note per change.\n\nInterest reply → company REPLIED + Opportunity (NEW → SCREENING → MEETING → PROPOSAL → CUSTOMER) + respond-task + the reply pasted into a note.\n\nUnsubscribe/negative reply → the pre-authorized opt-out procedure, executed instantly across all three systems.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
