      "text": "full Twenty export →\nraw/twenty/<date>-export-*.jsonl ·\nthree-way count reconcile (store vs Twenty\nvs Apollo) · UI-side edits to M8-owned\nfields → queue/ for human review, never\nsilently absorbed or clobbered. Dropped\naccounts are expected ABSENT; one found\npresent is a stray.",
