      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "raw/ filenames are timestamped and machine-unique → append-only and conflict-free. account.yaml is THE conflict surface: lib/conflict-scan.ts scans for *.sync-conflict* at every run start and routes hits to queue/ — never ignored, never auto-merged. Soft single-writer convention: scheduled/headless writes on one host, interactive sessions on the other. Secrets stay per-host in\n~/.config/gtm-prospect-pipeline/env (chmod 600).",
      "originalText": "raw/ filenames are timestamped and machine-unique → append-only and conflict-free. account.yaml is THE conflict surface: lib/conflict-scan.ts scans for *.sync-conflict* at every run start and routes hits to queue/ — never ignored, never auto-merged. Soft single-writer convention: scheduled/headless writes on one host, interactive sessions on the other. Secrets stay per-host in ~/.config/gtm-prospect-pipeline/env (chmod 600).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
